      ],
      "source_text": "",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "表中先把电流所做的功取近似值，再按效率计算有用功，因此下面给出的有用功也是近似值。\n$A_1=\\frac{4000000\\text{ 焦耳}\\times80\\%}{100\\%}=3200000$焦耳",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 356,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0367#6"
      ],
      "source_text": "$A_1=\\frac{4000000\\text{ 焦耳}\\times80\\%}{100\\%}=3200000$焦耳",
      "changes": [
        "clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$=3.2\\times10^6$焦耳$=3.2\\times10^3$千焦耳。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
